              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuwinja, E cula; man wucik ithwu, wu kodhidhanu, ku bor: Yehova goyo wia kud i ic; elwong’o nyinga kud i ma: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.4.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ebr 4:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.1.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nyu 1:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man etimo dhoga calu palamularu ma bith; epana i tipo m’i cinge: man etima ni athero m’aruda; egwoka ki i tubu pare: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man ewacu ira kumae, In i jatic para; Israel, m’abinwang’u dwong’ ni kumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento awacu kumae, Amula ku tic mananu, alalu tego para pi gin moko ngo ku gin ma ie nanu; ento pokolembe m’umaka ni ku Yehova andha, man sukulia para ni ku Mungu para.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kawono Yehova m’ung’ina kud i ic kara abed jatic pare, kara adwok Yakobo kendo i bang’e, man kara jucok Israel i bang’e (kum abedo mi yung i wang’ Yehova, man Mungu para doko ni tegona) ewacu kumae; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.42.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 42:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.2.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 2:32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.26.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tic 26:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.13.47"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tic 13:47",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eyo, ewacu kumae, En e gin ma yot hai nia ibed jatic para ya iting’ suru pa Yakobo malu, man idwok ju m’ubedo agwoka mir Israel: abimii bende ni der ni Thekdhanumange, kara ibed ni both para cil i kajik mi ng’om. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova, Jawar mir Israel man Ng’atu Maleng’ pare uwacu kumeni ni ng’atu ma dhanu cayu, ni ng’atu ma thek udagu, ni jatic mi jubim: Ju m’ubimo bineno man gibiai; judongomawijo, e gibirwo; ni kum Yehova ma en e mandha, en e Ng’atu Maleng’ mir Israel, m’ugoyo wii.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
